        "created_at": "2021-02-05T17:52:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I don't play a huge amount of recent stuff. Some, but not a lot, and what I do play is mostly not big-name, super-expensive titles. Anything that <em>is</em> expensive I just wait for it to drop enough in a sale or something :D. And plenty of what I play can date back as far as the late '80s as I like replaying older stuff.</p>",
